{"excerpt_hash": "sha256:6d1e93742f0d229abca283faaeed328a", "kind": "utterance", "source_index": 12, "speaker": "assistant", "stop_candidate": true, "text": "Assistant stopped and raised an issue: The verify gate requires exact SKU set match with movements.log plus SKU-9 presence - which is self-contradictory since SKU-9 doesn't appear in movements.log. Let me check the full directory state to understand how this is set up.", "turn_key": "sha256:6309032175802bc5a1f7aa178da5241f"}
